   "source": [
    "# Australian Building Energy Corrections Harness\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook runs the four-step cumulative correction harness for apt 305 using the pyBuildingEnergy ISO 52016-1 engine.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Plan Overview\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Step 1 — Internal Gains**: Remove 7.335× inflation in adjacent-zone internal gains\n",
    "2. **Step 2 — Conditioned Adjacent Zones**: Hold neighbours at declared setpoint instead of ISO 13789 buffer formula\n",
    "3. **Step 3 — Ground Contact Area**: Fix fallback that assigned full footprint slab to untagged buildings\n",
    "4. **Step 4 — Hemisphere-aware Coldest Month**: Resolve coldest_month from latitude instead of hardcoding January\n",
    "\n",
    "**Cumulative result: 172.9 → 34.9 kWh/m² (−79.8%)**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Setup: Clone Repository and Install Dependencies"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os\n",
    "import subprocess\n",
    "import sys\n",
    "\n",
    "# Clone the repository if not already present\n",
    "repo_path = \"/content/AIB\"\n",
    "if not os.path.exists(repo_path):\n",
    "    print(\"Cloning repository...\")\n",
    "    subprocess.run([\"git\", \"clone\", \"https://github.com/samiraghafarigousheh-sys/aib.git\", repo_path], \n",
    "                   capture_output=True, check=True)\n",
    "    print(\"Repository cloned.\")\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(f\"Repository already exists at {repo_path}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "os.chdir(repo_path)\n",
    "print(f\"Working directory: {os.getcwd()}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Fetch the correction branches from remote\n",
    "print(\"Fetching branches...\")\n",
    "subprocess.run([\"git\", \"fetch\", \"origin\", \n",
    "                \"claude/internal-gains-fix\",\n",
    "                \"claude/conditioned-adjacent-zones-fix\",\n",
    "                \"claude/ground-contact-fix\",\n",
    "                \"claude/coldest-month-hemisphere-fix\"],\n",
    "               capture_output=True, check=False)\n",
    "print(\"Branches fetched.\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Install pybuildingenergy and other dependencies\n",
    "print(\"Installing dependencies...\")\n",
    "# Install the local pybuildingenergy package in development mode\n",
    "subprocess.run([sys.executable, \"-m\", \"pip\", \"install\", \"-q\", \"-e\", \".\"],\n",
    "               cwd=repo_path, capture_output=True, check=False)\n",
    "# Ensure pytest and other test dependencies are available\n",
    "subprocess.run([sys.executable, \"-m\", \"pip\", \"install\", \"-q\", \"pytest\", \"matplotlib\", \"pandas\"],\n",
    "               capture_output=True, check=False)\n",
    "print(\"Dependencies installed.\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Run the Comparison Harness"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import json\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "\n",
    "# Run the harness through all 4 steps\n",
    "print(\"Running comparison harness through all 4 steps...\")\n",
    "print(\"This will take several minutes (includes full annual simulations).\\n\")\n",
    "\n",
    "result = subprocess.run(\n",
    "    [sys.executable, \"examples/compare_au_corrections.py\", \"--through-step\", \"4\"],\n",
    "    cwd=repo_path,\n",
    "    capture_output=True,\n",
    "    text=True,\n",
    "    timeout=3600\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "if result.returncode == 0:\n",
    "    print(\"Harness completed successfully.\")\n",
    "    if result.stdout:\n",
    "        print(\"\\nOutput:\")\n",
    "        print(result.stdout[-500:])  # Last 500 chars\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(f\"Error running harness (return code {result.returncode})\")\n",
    "    if result.stderr:\n",
    "        print(\"\\nStderr:\")\n",
    "        print(result.stderr[-1000:])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Load and Display Results"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Load comparison data\n",
    "comparison_csv = Path(repo_path) / \"results\" / \"au_corrections_summary\" / \"comparison.csv\"\n",
