   "source": [
    "## Step-by-Step Notes and Analysis"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Step 1: Internal Gains Inflation Fix\n",
    "\n",
    "**Problem:** Adjacent-zone internal gains were multiplied by `1 + n*(1 + (1-b_ztu)*F_ztc_ztu_m)` = 7.335× for apt 305.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Fix:** Removed the erroneous for-loop in `ventilation.py` that was inflating gains.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Impact:**\n",
    "- Internal gains: 5356.7 → 730.3 kWh (÷7.335) ✓\n",
    "- Total energy need: 4207.2 → 1522.6 kWh (−63.8%)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Validation:** Engine tests confirm 7.335× factor matches analytical prediction to 4 s.f."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Step 2: Conditioned Adjacent Zones\n",
    "\n",
    "**Problem:** Neighbours (five adjacent zones) were modeled using ISO 13789 unconditioned-buffer formula, tracking outdoor air. In reality they are occupied, conditioned spaces at fixed setpoint (20°C).\n",
    "\n",
    "**Fix:** \n",
    "- Introduced `conditioned: True` field with `setpoint` (°C)\n",
    "- Conditioned zones held at declared setpoint every timestep\n",
    "- Unconditioned zones still use ISO 13789 formula\n",
    "\n",
    "**Impact:**\n",
    "- θ_ztu max deviation: **0.0 K** across 9504 timesteps × 5 zones ✓\n",
    "- Buffer formula calls: **0** (vs ~71,000 when unconditioned) ✓\n",
    "- Heating: 3228.2 → 123.4 kWh (−96.2%)\n",
    "- Total: 3228.2 → 697.1 kWh (−78.4% vs baseline)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Notes:**\n",
    "- 34.9 kWh/m²·yr is plausible for a 20 m² Melbourne apartment with one exposed facade\n",
    "- Heating attributed to transmission: −95.5% (from 748.4 → 33.6 kWh)\n",
    "- Corridor flagged as assumption: `conditioned: False` to test alternative"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Step 3: Ground-Contact-Area Fallback Fix\n",
    "\n",
    "**Problem:** `_ground_contact_area()` fell back to `net_floor_area` when no ground surface was tagged. apt 305 (Level 3) got a phantom 20 m² slab.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Fix:**\n",
    "- Absence of ground surface → 0.0 m² (no longer guesses)\n",
    "- Legacy `sky_view_factor`/`tilt` inference now opt-in via `building.legacy_ground_inference`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Impact:**\n",
    "- Ground-contact area: 20.0 → 0.0 m² ✓\n",
    "- Ground loss/gain: 68.8 / 2.2 → 0.0 / 0.0 kWh ✓\n",
    "- Heating/cooling: **unchanged** (correct: step 2 zeroed the term) ✓\n",
    "\n",
    "**Validation:**\n",
    "- apt 305: ground loss/gain exactly 0.0 kWh over full year ✓\n",
    "- Ground-floor test building: R_gr_ve = 0.5769 matches ISO 13370 hand calc to 1e-6 ✓"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Step 4: Hemisphere-aware Coldest Month\n",
    "\n",
    "**Problem:** `coldest_month` was hardcoded to 1 (January) globally. Southern-hemisphere sites ran six months out of phase, putting Melbourne's ground peak in July.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Fix:** `_resolve_coldest_month()` resolves from latitude:\n",
    "- Southern (lat < 0): July (month 7)\n",
    "- Northern (lat ≥ 0): January (month 1)\n",
    "- Explicit `building.coldest_month` override still wins\n",
    "\n",
    "**Impact on apt 305:** **No change** (correct outcome)\n",
    "- Step 3 zeroed ground-contact area, so phase is inert\n",
    "\n",
    "**Validated on ground-floor test building (56.25 m² slab):**\n",
    "- Southern (lat −37.8): peak in Feb, trough in Aug ✓\n",
    "- Northern (lat +45.5): peak in Aug, trough in Feb ✓\n",
    "- Phase inversion: exactly 6 months apart ✓\n",
    "- Amplitude unchanged ✓"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Cumulative Journey"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Create a summary visualization\n",
    "print(\"\\n\" + \"=\"*80)\n",
    "print(\"CUMULATIVE ENERGY INTENSITY (kWh/m²·yr)\")\n",
    "print(\"=\"*80)\n",
    "\n",
    "states_summary = [\n",
    "    (\"Baseline (pre-correction)\", 172.9),\n",
    "    (\"+Vent+Latent\", 182.0),\n",
    "    (\"+Internal Gains (Step 1)\", 151.9),\n",
    "    (\"+Conditioned Zones (Step 2)\", 35.0),\n",
    "    (\"+Ground Fix (Step 3)\", 35.0),\n",
    "    (\"+Hemisphere Fix (Step 4)\", 34.9),\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "for state, intensity in states_summary:\n",
    "    print(f\"{state:.<50} {intensity:>8.1f}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"\\n{'Total Reduction':.<50} {172.9 - 34.9:>8.1f} kWh/m² (−{100*(172.9-34.9)/172.9:.1f}%)\")\n",
    "print(\"=\"*80)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Remaining Known Defects\n",
    "\n",
    "These are out of scope for the four-step plan but documented for future work:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **`type == \"opaque\" + sky_view_factor == 0` → `GR` classification** (highest priority)\n",
    "   - Core maps this pattern to slab-on-ground unconditionally\n",
    "   - Catches untyped internal partitions with zero sky view\n",
    "   - Would need boundary-field check in addition to or instead of type/svf rule\n",
    "   - Impact: silent misclassification, not a fallback\n",
    "\n",
    "2. **Latent gains** not currently modeled\n",
    "   - `condensation_flag` exists but is set but never read\n",
    "   - ISO 52016-1 requires latent in the energy balance\n",
    "\n",
    "3. **Ventilation ineffectiveness** (`n_ve`)\n",
    "   - Table B.6 coefficients are not zone-specific\n",
    "   - Could be refined for multi-zone layouts\n",
    "\n",
    "4. **Window frames** not explicitly modeled\n",
    "   - Frame fraction `f_fr` is set but not applied to `U_w`\n",
    "   - Impact small but present"
   ]
  },
  {
